	<TextRow
		Label="msg_n01r0401_boss_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Ctrl2:CtrlSpeed mode="1" ]この　しろの　いちばん　おく……
ボクにとって　たいせつな　ばしょで▽
キミと　むきあわねば　ならない……！▼
さあ
ついてきたまえ！[Ctrl2:CtrlSpeed ]▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-04T08:51:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-02T11:16:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Ctrl2:CtrlSpeed mode="1" ]この城の　一番　奥……
ボクにとって　大切な　場所で▽
キミと　向き合わねば　ならない……！▼
さあ
ついてきたまえ！[Ctrl2:CtrlSpeed ]▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-04T08:52:32" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-02T11:18:44" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・メッセージ表示後
　GRIDX＝13、GRIDZ＝20まで移動
・続けてboss_04</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-02T12:13:39" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
